ogleusercontent.com/-ghDSSkFlcBA/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAABg/ZCAHmYucz4M/s512-c/photo.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/11/donald-trumps-presidential-heel-turn.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2783825570807159491' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2783825570807159491' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1372258203"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 25, 2015 at 4:59 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-144245539025423944</id><published>2015-11-25T16:37:32.726-07:00</published><updated>2015-11-25T16:37:32.726-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Great article I never knew about the WWE experienc...</title><content type='html'>Great article I never knew about the WWE experience but I did wonder about Trump&amp;#39;s reality TV shows and how scripted this all seems. Is support for Trump a dying gasp for empire or another sad example of the human tendency to allow fascists to rise to power in politically troubled times?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2783825570807159491/comments/default/144245539025423944'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2783825570807159491/comments/default/144245539025423944'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/11/donald-trumps-presidential-heel-turn.html?showComment=1448494652726#c144245539025423944' title=''/><author><name>Genevieve Hawkins</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14101297491936916957</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//lh3.googleusercontent.com/-eRLya2SgbR0/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAABM/RVnwJ7FAYT8/s512-c/photo.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns